//// `scruffy` is a Gleam client for the
//// [Scryfall](https://scryfall.com/docs/api) Magic: The Gathering API.
////
//// The package currently ships the types modelling Scryfall's objects —
//// cards, sets, rulings, symbols, and the other resources it exposes — and
//// a `*_schema()` JSON decoder for each of them, built with
//// [Glon](https://hexdocs.pm/glon/). Request functions for calling the API
//// itself are on the roadmap.

